    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ricochet bullets back and take your chances!<br>Close combat shooting without shooting bullets</strong><br><br>The player has only a sword and cannot shoot bullets.<br>Moreover, the boss has deployed a shield, so even if you slash directly at him, you will not take damage. ......<br><br>So take advantage of the boss's attacks!<br>Aim at the special bullets and swing your sword to bounce them back.<br><br>If you hit the shield with a ricocheting bullet, it will explode! Destroy the shield and create a chance to attack directly!<br><br>Furthermore, ricocheting bullets can absorb enemy bullets.<br>If you guide them to absorb more enemy bullets, they will cause a powerful explosion and you will be able to cut down many shields at once!<br><br>Aim to destroy all 5 bosses and clear the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Ricochet bullets back and take your chances!<br>Close combat shooting without shooting bullets</strong><br><br>The player has only a sword and cannot shoot bullets.<br>Moreover, the boss has deployed a shield, so even if you slash directly at him, you will not take damage. ......<br><br>So take advantage of the boss's attacks!<br>Aim at the special bullets and swing your sword to bounce them back.<br><br>If you hit the shield with a ricocheting bullet, it will explode! Destroy the shield and create a chance to attack directly!<br><br>Furthermore, ricocheting bullets can absorb enemy bullets.<br>If you guide them to absorb more enemy bullets, they will cause a powerful explosion and you will be able to cut down many shields at once!<br><br>Aim to destroy all 5 bosses and clear the game.",
